		(uuid "71676a34-db23-45ae-b83d-b2bb75bf4014")
	)
	(text "Microcroconllers - 2 x ESP32 S3 CAM boards\n\nThe controller boards are fixated onto backboards which then connect vertically \nto this main board on Connectors Pin Socket 2x7 and 2x8. There are 11 GPIO drawn\nout to each of the connectors, and with 3.3V, GND and 5v, the total is 14. However,\nthe ESP32-S3 CAM A connects to a 2x8 connector in the sole purpose of prevent\nmistaken connections. The boards are facing to the sides - left and righ - for better\ncamera field of view.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7fe958aa-f4d6-49f3-a88c-a1a1e497225e")
	)
	(text "Motor drivers\n\nPin A0, A1 states are chosen so that the left motor is addresable on I2C\nat the address 0x63 and right motore at 0x64.\nThe Isense pin regulate the current load, limiting the current to a maximum driven by\nthe resistor value connected to GND. The value is 0.22 ohms, Ilimit = 200mV/R = 1A. \nThese are 2 resistors of 0.44 Ohm in parallel to increase power while reducing cost.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b006304f-f557-4e4d-a0a4-67c9bc5a4444")
	)
	(text "Mini OLED Display"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cd7f707e-fee2-4472-a678-7a78502ff869")
	)
	(text "I2S Digital Mic"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "de26c2a0-5c09-4998-b6aa-f05b7556c5d6")
	)
	(text "6D Inertial Measurement Unit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.79 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
